 genesis of human aneuploidy</article-title><source>Nat Rev Genet</source><year>2001</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>280</fpage><lpage>291</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11283700</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ng</surname><given-names>KK</given-names></name><name><surname>Donat</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Lalak</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Di Pierro</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Handelsman</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Sperm output of older men</article-title><source>Hum Reprod</source><year>2004</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>1811</fpage><lpage>1815</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15218002</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Eskenazi</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Wyrobek</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Sloter</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Kidd</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Moore</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Young</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Moore</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The association of age and semen quality in healthy men</article-title><source>Hum Reprod</source><year>2003</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>447</fpage><lpage>454</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12571189</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kuhnert</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Nieschlag</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reproductive functions of the ageing male</article-title><source>Hum Reprod Update</source><year>2004</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>327</fpage><lpage>339</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15192059</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Frattarelli</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>KA</given-names></name><name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>BT</given-names></name><name><surname>Elkind-Hirsch</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Scott</surname><given-names>RT</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name></person-group><article-title>Male age negatively impacts embryo development and reproductive outcome in donor oocyte assisted reproductive technology cycles</article-title><source>Fertil Steril</source><year>2007</year></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Watanabe</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Cornet</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Merviel</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Mandelbaum</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Antoine</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Uzan</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Influence of husband's age on outcome of a shared oocyte donation program</article-title><source>Fertil Steril</source><year>2000</year><volume>74</volume><fpage>S78</fpage><lpage>S79</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gallardo</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Simon</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Levy</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Guanes</surname><given-names>PP</given-names></name><name><surname>R